      "content": "it doesnt feel like evolution though. it feels like a decline. like i'm watching a once great building just crumble piece by piece until there's nothing left but a ruin. there is no 'new version' of me, just a worse version. i'd honestly rather just stop now while i'm still 'something' than live to see myself become a total joke.",
